"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Between the two, I’d take the brothel any day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There, I’ve got friends and "
"colleagues.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Although... ⟪k:6⟫I did lose a whole bunch of ’em four years ago."
